<doc node='c5451c12-75db' rev='9' sinceRev='1'><gap blocks='4'/><paragraph id='m9gc498ep5e.259' rev='2' h='0b5e7f85'><text id='.260'>Maintainers choosing a runtime for a new tooling script. A second runtime in a repository adds installation and </text><text id='.1724'>maintenance</text><text id='.378'> for every contributor.</text></paragraph><gap blocks='1'/><list id='.410' rev='3' h='b8b6299e' kind='ordered'><gap blocks='1'/><listItem id='.509' h='16cb53fa'><paragraph id='.510' h='8c3850d9'><text id='.511'>A repository with one runtime has </text><text id='.1735'>far </text><text id='.545'>less to install and maintain than one with two. Author's judgment.</text></paragraph></listItem><gap blocks='1'/></list><gap blocks='1'/><table id='.720' rev='9' h='aad1dc48'><gap blocks='1'/><row id='.751' rev='4' h='44d19eb5'><gap blocks='1'/><cell id='.788' h='8a85cef4'><paragraph id='.789' h='c6cc271e'><text id='.790'>Familiarity favo</text><text id='.1739'>u</text><text id='.806'>rs Node.js for that team; the thesis assumes the repository's existing runtime is Python</text></paragraph></cell><gap blocks='1'/></row><gone id='.913' rev='9' was='Distribution of a single script '/></table><gap blocks='1'/><table id='.1086' rev='7' h='8b2298d5'><gap blocks='1'/><row id='.1139' h='4dbab51f'><gap blocks='1'/><cell id='.1148' h='4fa693ad'><paragraph id='.1149' h='d70604e8'><text id='.1762'>Recommended</text></paragraph></cell><gap blocks='3'/></row></table><gap blocks='1'/><paragraph id='.1825' rev='9' h='cb912f3a'><text id='.1826'>A new paragraph about </text><text id='.1848'><bold>scope</bold></text><text id='.1853'> and </text><text id='.1858'><code>code</code></text><text id='.1862'> between the sections.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.1311' rev='8' h='ea414019'><text id='.1312'>The paper does not claim Python is better in general. It fails where the repository's existing runtime is Node.js, or a required library exists only for Node.js.</text><text id='.1773'>x</text></paragraph><gap blocks='1'/><table id='.1482' rev='9' h='cc84003e'><gap blocks='2'/><row id='.1774' h='3769201d'><cell id='.1775' h='71df1534'><paragraph id='.1776' h='b76161c3'><text id='.1777'>TA-002</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.1783' h='abe9810c'><paragraph id='.1784' h='cb4787fa'><text id='.1785'>Technology assessment</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.1806' h='576c7620'><paragraph id='.1807' h='7743ce34'><text id='.1808'>draft</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.1813' h='390a8a85'><paragraph id='.1814' h='c1c8aff1'><text id='.1815'>Objections</text></paragraph></cell></row></table><gap blocks='1'/><paragraph id='.1585' rev='5' h='f6acfc71'><text id='.1586'>Configure </text><text id='.1596'><code>app.yaml</code></text><text id='.1604'> and see </text><text id='.1613'><link href='https://example.com/guide'>the guide</link></text><text id='.1622'> and [[tech-spike]] for pg_cron </text><text id='.1740'>configuration</text><text id='.1659'>.</text></paragraph><list id='.1660' rev='6' h='0159eb18' kind='bullet'><listItem id='.1661' h='cd12b1fc'><gap blocks='1'/><list id='.1677' h='a165c5cc' kind='bullet'><gap blocks='1'/><listItem id='.1693' h='5ec57038'><paragraph id='.1694' h='f74c32a8'><text id='.1695'>Nested item b</text><text id='.1753'> (edited)</text></paragraph></listItem></list></listItem><gap blocks='1'/></list></doc>
